Adds the reference material that makes the site citable rather than merely
findable, and wires it into every existing surface.

- data/methods.ts, answers.ts, glossary.ts, guides-expansion.ts
- /methods + /methods/[slug] with HowTo schema and when/when-not framing
- /answers + /answers/[slug] with QAPage schema; the index renders all 28 in
  full under FAQPage so an answer engine can cite from one fetch
- /glossary as a single DefinedTermSet page, anchored per term — deliberately
  NOT 22 thin URLs
- guides 9 -> 19
- search index, sitemap, llms.txt, llms-full.txt, ai.txt, header, footer, and
  service pages all extended
- 18 new tests covering cross-link integrity and content depth
- docs/QUERY-INVENTORY, DISCOVERY, HONEST-LIMITS, SATELLITE-ARCHITECTURE

181 prerendered pages, 181 unique titles, 959 JSON-LD blocks.
