+  {
+    slug: "nail-down",
+    term: "Nail-down",
+    short: "Hidden-fastened solid hardwood into a wood subfloor.",
+    definition:
+      "The classic house assembly: solid boards blind-nailed or stapled to a wood subfloor. Correct on dry joists. Wrong on concrete.",
